WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,920
You're naked when you see it

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:03,260
think about our people

3
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:05,380
Think of the women who were bought and sold because they were hungry

4
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:06,540
People who know each other by name

5
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,780
I grabbed a piece of land from Xia Guo

6
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:10,300
Our race can grow stronger

7
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:11,820
Our descendants will not have to suffer

8
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:13,540
This is our only chance

9
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:15,020
Those people agreed to support us

10
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:17,060
The right time, the right place and the right people are all here.

11
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:18,580
Dad Li doesn’t love you anymore

12
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:23,170
It’s not the people who are important

13
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:26,680
But your father can still give birth, otherwise

14
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:29,400
You let him drown himself now to prove it

15
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:36,380
I know you want to pass the throne to your second brother

16
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:37,740
No wonder you talked to the Federation

17
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:39,060
Take him with you during the sneak attack on Xia Kingdom

18
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,140
No wonder he was the one to receive the federal funding for the war.

19
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:43,570
You've been expecting me to die for a long time, right?

20
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,500
Chen Haoyu let me go

21
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:50,020
I can pick it up in front of the whole world
